23:15.797 --> 23:18.817
LILY!!

23:18.817 --> 23:19.567
RIGHT?!

23:19.567 --> 23:20.317
HEY!

23:20.317 --> 23:21.067
LILY!!

23:21.067 --> 23:21.817
HEY!

23:21.817 --> 23:22.567
HEY!!

23:22.567 --> 23:23.317
LILY!!

